00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,812
Lucia handed Jason a thin envelope. He
had crossed the waterfront

2
00:00:04,812 --> 00:00:07,000
expecting the money she promised.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:12,833
The storm had taken her bag, her phone,
and every dollar from the job. She

4
00:00:12,833 --> 00:00:14,000
